<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">silver-helm</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A helm of silver, against iron: protection x0.85, weight x1.1. +2 magical
protection. Silver is too soft to be a soldier's metal, but it is quick in
the hand and it wards against what is not flesh.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 22)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> silver ingot (x3), leather strip (x1)

